     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"border:none;padding:0in;line-height:100%\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\" size=\"2\">&gt; readland.tps(file.choose())</font></font></font>\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#0000ff\"><font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\" size=\"2\">&gt; myShapeData_tps=readland.tps(file.choose())</font></font></font>\r\n\r\n<a name=\"m_-31611199513156471_rstudio_console_output20\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><font color=\"#0000ff\"><font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\" size=\"2\">&gt; fixed.angle(myShapeData_tps,<a href=\"http://art.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://art.pt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485174541000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tG_l8CZPnYZMwWFaNYXdq\">art.pt</a>=1,angle.pts=c(5,6),rot.pts=c(2,3,4,5))</font></font></font>\r\n\r\n<a name=\"m_-31611199513156471_rstudio_console_output19\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><font color=\"#0000ff\"><font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\" size=\"2\">&gt; fixedData=fixed.angle(myShapeData_tps,<a href=\"http://art.pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://art.pt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485174541000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tG_l8CZPnYZMwWFaNYXdq\">art.pt</a>=1,angle.pts=c(5,6),rot.pts=c(2,3,4,5))</font></font></font>\r\n\r\n<font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\" size=\"2\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">&gt; myData.super &lt;- gpagen(fixedData)</font></font></font>\r\n\r\n<a name=\"m_-31611199513156471_rstudio_console_output22\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\" size=\"2\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">&gt; </font><font color=\"#0000ff\">plotTangentSpace(myData.super, axis1 = 1, axis2 = 2, warpgrids = TRUE, mesh = NULL, label = FALSE, verbose = FALSE)</font></font></font>\r\n\r\n<a name=\"m_-31611199513156471_rstudio_console_output23\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><font color=\"#0000ff\"><font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\" size=\"2\">stuck here… says </font></font></font><font color=\"#ce181e\"><font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\" size=\"2\">“</font></font></font><font color=\"#ce181e\"><font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\" size=\"2\">Error in plotTangentSpace(myData.super, axis1 = 1, axis2 = 2, warpgrids = TRUE,  :</font></font></font><font color=\"#ce181e\"> </font><font color=\"#ce181e\"><font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\" size=\"2\">Data matrix not a 3D array (see &#39;arrayspecs&#39;).”<br><br>Hi all, my partner and I are stuck in writing code to use the geomorph package. Above is some of our code thus far and where we are stuck. Any advice on what we may have done wrong would be much appreciated!<br><br></font></font></font></pre>\r\n\r\n</div>"
